# Qwen3.8-27B RVN (abliterated), IQ3_M. Only 16 of its 64 layers keep a KV cache, so context is
# cheap. Compose stores the cache as q8_0 (OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE): 33 MiB per 1k tokens, measured
# 2026-10-04 (952 MiB at 28k, against 1,792 MiB at f16). The whole model must stay on the
# RTX 5080: at f16, 32k left 1 of 65 layers on the CPU (2026-09-24). 40k is 1,360 MiB of cache,
# 65 of 65 layers on the GPU and about 15.3 of 16.3 GB used, so there is little room past it.
# The hub's LLM_CONTEXT_TOKENS must match num_ctx.
FROM /root/.ollama/imports/qwen3.8-rvn.gguf
RENDERER qwen3.8
PARSER qwen3.5
PARAMETER num_ctx 40960
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1
